requirements payment_terms v1
description "A test material: the payment day of koyomi's example payment_20th_close_next_10th.cal. The source of the closed days is borrowed from the table of national holidays the calendar file pins. The terms of payment are written for this material"

role accounting "Decides the terms of payment"

source holidays = koyomi "calendars/tokyo_business_days.cal" source national_holidays

requirement payment_day
  text "Closes on the 20th, pays on the 10th of the next month. When the payment day is closed, pays on the business day before"
  in force 2026-10-01..
  owner accounting
  from @holidays
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by accounting sha256:cec37a743c96995c -> sha256:dd7089d2bc2f76e0
  satisfied by koyomi "payment_20th_close_next_10th.cal" date payment
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by accounting sha256:dd7089d2bc2f76e0 -> sha256:77727589d8318079
  verified by koyomi "payment_20th_close_next_10th.cal" claim paid_on_a_business_day
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by accounting sha256:dd7089d2bc2f76e0 -> sha256:a30c094c89e283df
